## Original content (preserved for reference)

After completing meaningful work:

- Update `TASKS.md`:
  - mark completed tasks
  - add discovered issues
- Update `STATUS.md` if the working state changed.
- Update `DECISIONS.md` if a design decision was made.
- Update `CHANGELOG.md` for user-visible changes.
- Keep documentation concise and factual.
- Do not duplicate the same rule in many files.
- Do not delete historical decisions unless explicitly requested.
